text.section:
The fee for a permit to net fish in inland waters, for private table use, or for sale where permitted, shall be as follows:

County dip net, three dollars and fifty cents each per year;


Gill net, eight dollars each per year;


Haul seine, seventeen dollars and fifty cents each per year; and


Haul seine to catch species designated by the Board for sale, forty-five dollars each per year.
